<title>UK: Norway's Troll crude to load 7.4 mln bbls in July.</title>
<headline>Norway's Troll crude to load 7.4 mln bbls in July.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Troll oilfield is scheduled to load 7.4 million barrels of crude oil in July compared to 7.2 million barrels in June, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The July programme consists of six cargoes of 600,000 barrels, four of 400,000 barrels and one each of one million, 700,000 and 500,000 barrels, they said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
